  "title": "Global Expansion of Green Energy and Environmental Renewal",
  "summary": "The Indian government extends the validity of environmental clearances for ports, harbours, and dredging projects, with a renewed period of up to 20 years, marking a significant step in sustainable development.",
  "facts": [
    {
      "statement": "The environmental clearances for ports, harbours, and dredging projects will be valid for up to 20 years, with extensions of up to five years each.",
      "confidence": 0.95
    },
    {
      "statement": "The extension comes after the ministry proposed a 15-year validity period initially, followed by two further extensions of up to five years each.",
